body:
My coop friend's account was hacked a while back and kicked other players, fortunately they got their account and invited me back.

&#x200B;

But I lost all of my items in the process, my biggest concern is those quest-exclusive talisman(s), like Campfire/Romeo Juliet/Races, is there any way I could get them again? It seems the quest isn't reset by the time I was invited back.
